{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mother Nature Shows No Mercy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bug Bane Survivors</strong> places you not at the bottom of the food chain, but at the very top. As a furious mutated plant, turn the thousands of bugs trying to eat you into fertilizer for your growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just about survival; it's about revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/9fbcdf474d324c664121a2885be93ace.poster.avif?t=1768984528\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/9fbcdf474d324c664121a2885be93ace.webm?t=1768984528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/9fbcdf474d324c664121a2885be93ace.mp4?t=1768984528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf31 TAKE ROOT, MUTATE, DESTROY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a simple sprout, evolve into a deadly forest. In <strong>Bug Bane Survivors</strong>, every run is unique.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limitless Build Possibilities:</strong> Toxic thorns, explosive pollen, and swords raining from the sky... Design your own death machine with hundreds of item combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manual Aiming:</strong> Unlike other games, there are no auto-attacks here. Amidst the chaos, you must choose where to strike. Trust your reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Feast:</strong> Feel the satisfying chaos of hundreds of enemies exploding on screen simultaneously.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/5b0a205ad29f8c800da0370bc0aa2746.poster.avif?t=1768984528\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/5b0a205ad29f8c800da0370bc0aa2746.webm?t=1768984528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/5b0a205ad29f8c800da0370bc0aa2746.mp4?t=1768984528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>TAKE THE RISK AND CLAIM YOUR REWARD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewards aren't served on a silver platter here. You have to seize them.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timed Chest Mechanic:</strong> Upon leveling up, 3 chests appear, but only one holds the true treasure. You have <strong>only a few seconds</strong> to make your choice and break the chest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed and Focus:</strong> Find the right chest, smash it quickly, grab your reward, and return to the fight. Hesitate, and the reward vanishes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/188107926a8d3aefc7e7b02e03d2c257.poster.avif?t=1768984528\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/188107926a8d3aefc7e7b02e03d2c257.webm?t=1768984528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/188107926a8d3aefc7e7b02e03d2c257.mp4?t=1768984528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2620\ufe0f 5 DISTINCT ZONES, EVOLVING MISSIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merely wiping out the swarm isn't enough; every map offers a unique challenge.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective-Based Gameplay:</strong> Sometimes you'll defend a vital <strong>BioCore</strong> or the <strong>Eye Stone</strong>\u2014the plants' last hope\u2014and other times you'll race against the clock just to save your own skin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Boss Battles:</strong> At the end of each map, the king of that ecosystem awaits you. One might trap you in a confined space, while others lay entirely different deadly snares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Depth:</strong> As you progress through 5 different maps, piece together the story behind the mutation and the world's collapse.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adapt. Aim. Overcome.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are no longer the gardener; you are <strong>the garden itself.</strong></p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830770?t=1768984528","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830770?t=1768984528","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/a5fb0d32941033acb278bf6c47b15e40caf51070/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768984528","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/a5fb0d32941033acb278bf6c47b15e40caf51070/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768984528","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3983150,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mother Nature Shows No Mercy!</strong></h2><