out the swarm isn't enough; every map offers a unique challenge.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective-Based Gameplay:</strong> Sometimes you'll defend a vital <strong>BioCore</strong> or the <strong>Eye Stone</strong>\u2014the plants' last hope\u2014and other times you'll race against the clock just to save your own skin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Boss Battles:</strong> At the end of each map, the king of that ecosystem awaits you. One might trap you in a confined space, while others lay entirely different deadly snares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Depth:</strong> As you progress through 5 different maps, piece together the story behind the mutation and the world's collapse.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adapt. Aim. Overcome.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are no longer the gardener; you are <strong>the garden itself.</strong></p>","developers":["The Cipher Ink."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/d676c465675e47e3a799fdafe68286282aec90db/header.jpg?t=1768984528","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3830770/698653580/66df27f9db11b8f7a765bea891bb6f13f0415c0e/1765633061/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768143579","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3830770/698653580/66df27f9db11b8f7a765bea891